  "notes": "One consensus event carries the Void; the capture note's count of two also counted its copy among the 22 diagnostic events, which are never read. The movement's asset is the token contract (rule M-7), its routing is void (rule M-2: no routing ID; a reader that reports a value is wrong), and count 1 pins the drop. The recipient CD4NL2R7... is a contract whose own ledger entries did not change (its balance lives in the token's storage), so it is a movement endpoint, not a must-include participant. The plan also names testnet ledger 1000280 (corpus/objects/testnet/1000280) for this pattern; it is a different ledger with different whole-ledger counts, so it cannot be a variant sharing this expect block and is not included. The go-stellar-sdk token-transfer-processor pin (fixed in v0.7.3) has not been executed against this ledger, so it is not a known divergence."
